.go:1086-1094) counts voters from r.configurations.latest, and commitment.setConfiguration (commitment.go:53-64) rebuilds the match-index voter set from the new configuration. appendConfigurationEntry (raft.go:1203-1240) must therefore only install a configuration that exists in the log, but it calls dispatchLogs first and then unconditionally runs setLatestConfiguration / commitment.setConfiguration / startStopReplication. dispatchLogs (raft.go:1244-1283) assigns applyLog.log.Index before StoreLogs and returns after responding the error\ngraph_version: 1\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
