ommitted configuration (raft.go:1530), processConfigurationLogEntry installs the configuration of an entry just stored or read from the log (raft.go:1585-1600), installSnapshot installs the received snapshot configuration (raft.go:1937), and startup restore installs the snapshot configuration (api.go:664). The injected StoreLogs failure and the unreachable phantom address are explicitly supplied preconditions, not produced by real producers. Preflight validation returned valid true. No source, evidence, credential or dependency files were modified; only draft/submission.json and draft/probe_config_publish_test.go changed.\"}"}}
